[682.963, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ ▸ Step 6/8 · Judge\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The outside check is `accept.js`. It runs the promises from the restatement as pass/fail tests: the solver,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  a real Chrome run, layout measurements at five sizes, contrast numbers and a dump of all on-screen text for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  a cold read. It also runs the same checks on the first version.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
